er":null,"call_locator":"1ea44c7665eea229d5d2998a011d1996f7abed1fa6df636a420c76cc72b95e2b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2c8b9720a21283157a4b3e78c3069b0d5e9aab624af4dacddfac28637ac7209b","logical_entry_identity":"f230cb96f575158ce6361552b47689e7c01783e2db597900271b1196bf6ec3e1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"With a sudden jolt you find yourself... somewhere familiar. The smooth walls and gentle lighting remind you of your fortress. And yet it feels different too. There is a gentle humming noise in the background, and your whole body feels light, almost weightless, such that the slightest movement propels you into the air. You have the odd feeling that you are not on Maj'Eyal any longer... From ahead you sense something both terrible and wonderful, and trepidation fills every corner of your being.","source_tag":"_t","target":"随着突然的震动，你发现自己身处某个熟悉的地方。那光滑的墙壁和柔和的灯光让你想起自己的堡垒。不过它仍然有所不同。背景中传来轻柔的嗡嗡声，你感觉整个身体轻飘飘的，几乎像羽毛一样，似乎你轻轻的移动都能跃至半空。你有着一种奇异的感觉——你似乎不在马基·埃亚尔了……在你的前方你感到了某种既可怕又美妙的东西，恐惧充满了你身心的每个角落。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"29d907603c1f62499b7de96eb0307f795c10ea13addbee90fed1694bfb0a45ca","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"46ee83484a799db5d8bed261c99d57cbab0208c50324c4b5bac4a4f740f1783f","logical_entry_identity":"85cb601496c58748d60b3033578e972c83eeb82934befc74e165f74b0551898d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The sleeping poison of your Dart Launcher becomes potent enough to ignore immunity, and upon waking the target is slowed by %d%% for 4 turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的飞镖发射器的睡眠毒素强效到足以无视免疫，且使目标醒来后减速 %d%% 4 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8a79c854458812b5ddc2a75b10800fbf46a301230ceaee9b8bd79d2e295ec9d4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d996ed95e521b8b4840168dfa7804d1fd8f53fb52112646a60a460974b647e6d","logical_entry_identity":"dfbb06b52a621df6798095e21ac469769262a33a77e08a31f6837eda74e606ee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Each time one of your foes bites the dust, you feel a surge of power, increasing your strength by 2 (stacking up to a maximum of %d) for %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"每当你让一个敌人扑街，你会漏出一股汹涌的霸气，增加你 2 点力量，上限 %d，持续 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"997f5e2943298c97b4e9f3320a0dccdab2b55384ee6edcb043fef9897c4f5d6c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d99d884e54147618e6aa8fb1fd2152930525a9ace762b0183540c2bf50726490","logical_entry_identity":"b0b626fe2a55506868d4abbe5b473d495de69d1996d95cd0e3d27a8b8f7b4fa0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Places between three and six talents of up to 5 targets in a radius %d ball on cooldown for up to %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"让半径 %d 范围内最多五个单位的三到六个技能进入冷却 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"074aefcf6a391653cc39a703a50b3cd9991f548bbef9dcd6284fe1e46ad3a3d9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d99eea5c202ab076a3e34d621d80f662e89ca19d5fc40aae21d0f107fc2ee700","logical_entry_identity":"33900fd36bb744d766eea0bec92c6ae4cf75264f236030a2f57903bef8de4270","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"There must be a way to go into the far east from the lair of Golbug. Find it and explore the unknown far east, looking for clues.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在高尔布格巢穴内肯定有一条通往远东大陆的路，去寻找线索并找到它，然后探索那未知而遥远的东方。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7cf18e847114a5aec39d361bf4f9e3d672da86e88c0ec47e48d63dd42d5a3376","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d99f486dcad5ded5f7861e06c7cee39937ce31c693e29d3f45b3499d8501736b","logical_entry_identity":"a0251b2cc520bd3e07cd639b9d6cda51473b750322f427a55e03bd37c519bb27","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Resonance Field","source_tag":"_t","target":"共鸣领域"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"400fab46350df42e15ebc09d3f2252d41c7188f57c601a842f0ad0ca5cbf92c9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d9a2fd61016bf114e1e0b7bf50d95769c4b20aedeb8a77f8d524ec01e2356979","logical_entry_identity":"a03dcc9414de55c00f2831a7cac05fa16181670a06dbd79300d42176589a285c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua"